  "control_analysis": "Preserve the AP/P analysis and all observations. Compare each BC to its own ED. Use matched-seed differences, including covariance, for AP/P minus P/P and ED-adjusted residuals. Report both seed SE and pooled/reblocked-bin diagnostics for both boundaries without choosing a favorable method. No simulation extension or physical acceptance threshold chosen from control outcomes."
